KinOrder   2  (Max order in the kinetic energy expansion)
PotOrder   8   (Max order in the potential energy expansion)

Natoms 6       (Number of atoms)
Nmodes 12      (Number of modes = 3*Natoms-6)

(ACTIVE SPACE CUTOFFS:)
PRIMITIVES
  Npolyads    6     (how many polyads we calculate)
  enercut    80000.   (energy cut in the primitive matrix for the diagonalization)
END

CONTRACTION
  Npolyads   6      (how many polyads we calculate)
  enercut    80000.0   (energy cut in the primitive matrix for the diagonalization)
  coeff_thresh    1.0d-12
  degeneracy      1d-02
  sample_points   40
  sample_attempts 500
  symm_toler      1.0d-8
END

SYMGROUP C3v(M)-2

iron-out

DIAGONALIZER
  SYEVR     (syev-default, syevr - optional, nroots or uplimit can be given)
  uplimit 12000.0
end


dstep 1.e-3   (finite difference element for each mode )
COORDS local

TRANSFORM  R-ALPHA132-THETA-S-TAU
frame      R-ALPHA-THETA-TAU-OH-CLOCKWISE

MOLTYPE ch3oh
MOLECULE CH3OH
REFER-CONF NON-RIGID


